{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "觉察内心感受", "content": "情绪过后要敏锐觉察内心感受，发现自己在什么情绪里面。觉察时不是用情绪轮对照情绪，而是感受内心的感受，让自己浸泡在感受中，享受当下的感受。觉察内心感受还包括问自己为什么有这样的感受。", "steps": ["情绪过后觉察内心感受", "不急于用情绪轮指认情绪", "让自己浸泡在感受中", "问自己为什么有这样的感受"], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["觉察", "感受"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-f8591e3708ce-c001:a002", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-f8591e3708ce", "blocks": ["b00002", "b00003"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-f8591e3708ce-c001:a022", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-f8591e3708ce-c001:u0002", "evidence": "point_source_review"}, {"target": "s-f8591e3708ce-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "complements", "condition": "适用于觉察阶段", "reason": "source 提到认知自己，候选补充觉察内心感受的具体方法，是六步骤第一步的细化。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-f8591e3708ce-c001:u0002"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "distinction", "title": "情绪与感受的区别", "content": "情绪是对外的，如愤怒、生气、同情；感受是对内的，如疼痛、无助、不知所措、悲伤。外部事件勾起情绪，情绪转换到内部变成感受。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["情绪", "感受", "区分"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-f8591e3708ce-c001:a003", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-f8591e3708ce", "blocks": ["b00005", "b00008", "b00009", "b00004"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-f8591e3708ce-c001:a002", "kind": "supports", "condition": "", "reason": "“情绪与感受的区别”区分了情绪和感受，“觉察内心感受”强调觉察感受而非情绪，前者为后者提供了概念基础。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": "支持关系成立。"}, {"target": "legacy:qx-c-07", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：区分情绪与感受；旧原子从时间特性区分，候选从内外和对内对外角度区分，两者互补。", "reason": "候选补充了情绪对外、感受对内的视角。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-f8591e3708ce-c001:u0003"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "感受的来源：过去的记忆", "content": "感受可能来自过去的记忆。过去的经历被当前事件勾起，引发相似感受。例如，看到孩子被打的视频感到心痛，是因为记忆反射被打的疼痛；孩子哭声与过去母亲哭声频率相似，勾起童年愤怒和无助的记忆；喝一碗热汤感到幸福，是因为记忆中有连接幸福的东西。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["记忆", "感受来源"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-f8591e3708ce-c001:a004", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-f8591e3708ce", "blocks": ["b00010", "b00011", "b00012"], "source_kind": "A1"}, {"source_id": "s-f8591e3708ce", "blocks": ["b00004", "b00005", "b00010", "b00011", "b00012", "b00013"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-f8591e3708ce-c001:a002", "kind": "supports", "condition": "", "reason": "“感受的来源：过去的记忆”说明感受可能来自过去记忆，有助于理解“觉察内心感受”中感受到的来源。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": "支持关系成立。"}, {"target": "legacy:qx-ca-06", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用条件1：需要解释感受来源于过去记忆的机制；共同适用条件2：旧案例提供具体例子，候选概念提供一般原理并列举多样例子。", "reason": "候选概念“感受可能来自过去的记忆”为旧案例提供了理论解释，补充了记忆引发相似感受的一般规律。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-f8591e3708ce-c001:u0004"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
